OL,5,G0232 Tech Life
OL,6,     FMillions of us play on consoles,
OL,7,     Flaptops and phones - it's big
OL,8,     Fbusiness. Grand Theft Auto 6 is
OL,9,     Fthe latest blockbuster release.
OL,10,     FBut is gaming having an impact on
OL,11,     Fthe environment?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FAn Italian widow, 83, fell for a
OL,17,     F91-year-old American widower she
OL,18,     Fcan't even speak to. The
OL,19,     Fmatchmaker behind their romance
OL,20,     Fhad a 40-year-old reason for
OL,21,     Fbringing them together.
